1
00:01:28,899 --> 00:01:34,705
THE FURIOUS FISTS OF HONDARA

2
00:02:01,065 --> 00:02:03,434
Ryo-sama, I'll be right there.

3
00:02:09,573 --> 00:02:10,207
Hmm?

4
00:02:14,778 --> 00:02:15,613
Ryo-sama.

5
00:02:15,846 --> 00:02:16,680
Ugh!

6
00:02:16,981 --> 00:02:18,682
H-Hey! Don't barge in here, Maria!

7
00:02:19,383 --> 00:02:21,318
Oh my, Ryo-sama... Don't be shy.

8
00:02:21,886 --> 00:02:24,288
We're husband and wife from today, aren't we?

9
00:02:24,522 --> 00:02:25,956
A-Are we?

10
00:02:26,390 --> 00:02:29,627
Ryo-sama, I'm happy.

11
00:02:30,060 --> 00:02:30,995
Gulp!

12
00:02:31,528 --> 00:02:34,431
I'll get in too!

13
00:02:35,132 --> 00:02:35,999
Ryo-sama!

14
00:02:36,233 --> 00:02:39,003
Oh no, stop, stop!

15
00:02:39,603 --> 00:02:41,472
Stop!

16
00:02:46,176 --> 00:02:47,745
Just a dream...

17
00:02:47,945 --> 00:02:50,881
What a crazy dream to have first thing in the morning...

18
00:02:51,815 --> 00:02:52,483
Hmm?

19
00:02:54,485 --> 00:02:55,119
Eeek!

20
00:02:59,623 --> 00:03:00,424
Huh?

21
00:03:04,128 --> 00:03:06,263
Good morning, Ryo-sama.

22
00:03:07,464 --> 00:03:11,035
What?! Maria! Why are you here?

23
00:03:12,303 --> 00:03:15,439
I know. I must still be dreaming.

24
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:16,907
That must be it.

25
00:03:17,107 --> 00:03:18,375
A dream like this...

26
00:03:18,609 --> 00:03:22,112
Wake up, wake up, wake up already!

27
00:03:22,313 --> 00:03:23,514
Ow... that hurt.

28
00:03:23,847 --> 00:03:27,318
Ryo-sama, you're still half asleep, aren't you?

29
00:03:27,618 --> 00:03:30,054
Why are you here?

30
00:03:31,455 --> 00:03:33,691
I have nowhere to go.

31
00:03:33,924 --> 00:03:34,959
What do you mean?

32
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:38,963
I asked to move into the same dorm as you,

33
00:03:39,163 --> 00:03:41,932
but they said I couldn't, not looking like this.

34
00:03:42,366 --> 00:03:45,636
Of course not! Then go stay in the women's dorm.

35
00:03:46,203 --> 00:03:49,306
They turned me down too for being a guy.

36
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:53,077
So in the end, I decided to crash in your room.

37
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,678
You can't decide that!

38
00:03:55,546 --> 00:03:57,014
Is it... not okay?

39
00:04:00,351 --> 00:04:02,052
Don't give me those lovey-dovey eyes!

40
00:04:02,620 --> 00:04:05,789
You're the only one I can rely on at the police.

41
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,825
What should I do...?

42
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,728
Don't cry!

43
00:04:10,961 --> 00:04:13,564
Okay! I get it, so do what you want!

44
00:04:13,864 --> 00:04:15,566
Eh? So it's fine then!

45
00:04:15,799 --> 00:04:17,201
I guess there's no other way.

46
00:04:17,401 --> 00:04:20,537
Ryo-sama, I'm so happy!

47
00:04:24,742 --> 00:04:28,212
I've had this book borrowed for ages, so I need to return it.

48
00:04:31,215 --> 00:04:32,416
Ryotsu!

49
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:34,184
Ryotsu...

50
00:04:34,918 --> 00:04:36,987
Hold me tight!

51
00:04:38,889 --> 00:04:40,658
Did I get the wrong room?

52
00:04:41,392 --> 00:04:43,293
No, it's Ryotsu's room.

53
00:04:44,695 --> 00:04:46,230
Huh? Who's there?

54
00:04:47,031 --> 00:04:47,731
Excuse me...

55
00:04:48,232 --> 00:04:49,933
Oh, Honda, come in.

56
00:04:50,267 --> 00:04:52,269
G-Good morning.

57
00:04:52,469 --> 00:04:54,938
R-Ryotsu, who is that beautiful woman?

58
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:57,441
Eh? Hey, get away!

59
00:04:58,308 --> 00:05:00,944
Recently assigned to the Katsushika Police Department...

60
00:05:01,612 --> 00:05:04,214
I'm Ai Asato. Please call me Maria.

61
00:05:04,748 --> 00:05:07,718
Nice to meet you. I'm Honda from the traffic police.

62
00:05:08,152 --> 00:05:12,289
Honda-san, would you like to join us for breakfast? It'll be ready soon.

63
00:05:12,589 --> 00:05:13,957
Yeah, dig in, eat up!

64
00:05:14,391 --> 00:05:16,593
B-Breakfast?

65
00:05:16,794 --> 00:05:19,096
"NIKONIKO DORMITORY"

66
00:05:25,502 --> 00:05:29,406
Oh, delicious! It's been months since I last had a proper breakfast.

67
00:05:29,606 --> 00:05:31,308
The salmon's just about ready.

68
00:05:31,508 --> 00:05:33,410
What's wrong, Honda? No need to hold back.

69
00:05:33,610 --> 00:05:35,179
Come on, dig in. It's pretty good.

70
00:05:35,646 --> 00:05:38,582
I thought you'd be single forever, Ryotsu.

71
00:05:38,982 --> 00:05:40,718
But with such a beautiful woman...

72
00:05:41,118 --> 00:05:42,886
Oh, that's a misunderstanding.

73
00:05:43,087 --> 00:05:44,521
Listen.

74
00:05:45,522 --> 00:05:47,624
-What! A guy? -Yeah.

75
00:05:47,825 --> 00:05:50,094
Stop with that obvious lie!

76
00:05:50,294 --> 00:05:52,629
Come on, Ryotsu, even as a joke, that's too much!

77
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:54,431
I'm jealous of you...

78
00:05:54,631 --> 00:05:58,001
I'll probably get rejected for the rest of my life and die single.

79
00:05:58,202 --> 00:06:00,337
Why does it always end up like this for me...

80
00:06:00,537 --> 00:06:02,673
In the end, all I've got is my bike.

81
00:06:02,906 --> 00:06:04,108
I really envy you, Ryotsu.

82
00:06:04,308 --> 00:06:05,476
Don't sulk over nothing!

83
00:06:05,676 --> 00:06:07,845
I told you Maria is a guy!

84
00:06:08,078 --> 00:06:10,013
-Okay, come! -Eh?

85
00:06:11,281 --> 00:06:12,349
-Maria! -Yes?

86
00:06:12,549 --> 00:06:14,017
Here you go!

87
00:06:14,218 --> 00:06:16,353
Oh! A bulge!

88
00:06:16,553 --> 00:06:18,822
Eeek!

89
00:06:25,162 --> 00:06:29,366
Oh no! I forgot that Maria was a former kickboxing champion!

90
00:06:29,566 --> 00:06:30,200
Oh...

91
00:06:38,208 --> 00:06:40,511
I'm truly sorry, Honda-san.

92
00:06:40,711 --> 00:06:43,013
No, it was my fault.

93
00:06:43,213 --> 00:06:46,216
-Maria, you mustn't kick people anymore. -Eh?

94
00:06:46,650 --> 00:06:50,320
Listen, you're a former professional kickboxing champion.

95
00:06:50,587 --> 00:06:52,222
Your legs are deadly weapons.

96
00:06:52,689 --> 00:06:54,491
Even if it's to protect you?

97
00:06:54,792 --> 00:06:56,960
Absolutely not! Okay?

98
00:06:57,394 --> 00:06:59,863
Yes. I'll do as you say, Ryo-sama.

99
00:07:00,063 --> 00:07:00,731
Mm-hmm.

100
00:07:00,964 --> 00:07:03,267
You're not just cute, you're nice too.

101
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:06,703
But I can't believe that such a beautiful woman is a man.

102
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:09,039
That's the same with me.

103
00:07:09,239 --> 00:07:12,142
At one point, I even thought about marrying her.

104
00:07:12,342 --> 00:07:14,444
I'd still be okay with it.

105
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:20,684
Even if I know it's just a pad, this feeling is good.

106
00:07:22,753 --> 00:07:23,821
Ah, no, no!

107
00:07:24,021 --> 00:07:26,190
How can two men get married?!

108
00:07:26,390 --> 00:07:28,559
I love you so much...

109
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:30,027
Do you hate me?

110
00:07:30,227 --> 00:07:32,362
It's not about liking or not liking you!

111
00:07:32,563 --> 00:07:35,566
I mean, you know, with a man...

112
00:07:36,033 --> 00:07:40,070
Try to understand Maria-san's feelings. She's a woman at heart.

113
00:07:40,404 --> 00:07:44,208
Woman at heart? That's a man's heart! Because she's a man!

114
00:07:44,541 --> 00:07:48,178
But sometimes a man falls for another man's heart!

115
00:07:48,545 --> 00:07:50,080
That's not what I mean!

116
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:53,383
I even became a police officer because I adore you...

117
00:07:54,751 --> 00:07:56,420
Ah, you made her cry.

118
00:07:56,620 --> 00:08:00,557
I-I'm sorry. I'll make myself think of you as a woman.

119
00:08:00,757 --> 00:08:03,794
I'll try my best in my own way.

120
00:08:04,027 --> 00:08:06,029
So, don't cry.

121
00:08:06,496 --> 00:08:08,298
Really? I'm so happy!

122
00:08:09,333 --> 00:08:13,303
I don't know whether this feels good or bad.

123
00:08:17,341 --> 00:08:18,976
Thanks for the meal.

124
00:08:19,209 --> 00:08:21,979
Now, I'll go and secure a room for Maria.

125
00:08:22,212 --> 00:08:22,813
Eh?

126
00:08:23,447 --> 00:08:26,950
If I consider you a girl, we can't live together.

127
00:08:27,150 --> 00:08:29,820
Women aren't allowed in the men's dorm.

128
00:08:30,988 --> 00:08:31,622
But...

129
00:08:31,822 --> 00:08:36,326
Don't worry. If I talk to the head of the women's dorm, she won't say no.

130
00:08:36,526 --> 00:08:37,327
Leave it to me.

131
00:08:37,761 --> 00:08:41,131
You're really reliable, Ryo-sama.

132
00:08:52,075 --> 00:08:52,910
Did you see him?

133
00:08:53,110 --> 00:08:54,011
Yes, it's true.

134
00:08:54,811 --> 00:08:56,847
It was him. I saw him around here.

135
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,015
I'm counting on you.

136
00:08:58,448 --> 00:09:00,183
She'll be moving in tomorrow.

137
00:09:00,984 --> 00:09:01,952
That man!

138
00:09:02,319 --> 00:09:04,655
I can persuade anyone.

139
00:09:05,088 --> 00:09:07,624
I'll hurry back and tell Maria about it.

140
00:09:11,128 --> 00:09:13,163
I'm sure he is Coach Gantetsu.

141
00:09:13,363 --> 00:09:15,532
He's been infiltrating the police.

142
00:09:20,304 --> 00:09:21,972
Huh? What do you want?

143
00:09:23,373 --> 00:09:25,475
What do you guys want? Looking for students?

144
00:09:25,676 --> 00:09:29,479
I finally found you! This is the moment of reckoning, Iwao Gantetsu!

145
00:09:29,746 --> 00:09:31,214
Iwao Gantetsu?

146
00:09:31,682 --> 00:09:33,216
I've heard him somewhere before...

147
00:09:33,583 --> 00:09:35,719
Gantetsu, where did you hide the young master?

148
00:09:36,153 --> 00:09:38,488
The young master? What are you talking about?

149
00:09:38,689 --> 00:09:40,724
I'm not hiding anything!

150
00:09:41,024 --> 00:09:43,327
You're going to play dumb.

151
00:09:43,527 --> 00:09:47,331
I have no choice. I'll force you to answer, Iwao Gantetsu!

152
00:09:49,333 --> 00:09:51,868
Stop! You've got the wrong person. I'm not Gantetsu!

153
00:09:52,069 --> 00:09:53,437
I'm Kankichi Ryotsu!

154
00:09:53,770 --> 00:09:54,871
No question asked!

155
00:09:55,605 --> 00:09:57,074
Ah, it's actress Ryoko Suehiro!

156
00:09:57,341 --> 00:09:58,542
Huh, where is she?

157
00:09:58,775 --> 00:10:00,077
Hi-yah!

158
00:10:00,310 --> 00:10:01,044
What?

159
00:10:07,884 --> 00:10:10,988
Ouch, ouch... That was dirty, damn it!

160
00:10:11,188 --> 00:10:12,589
Ah, a 10,000-yen bill!

161
00:10:12,789 --> 00:10:14,157
Oops! Huh?

162
00:10:14,758 --> 00:10:15,592
Wait! Ugh!

163
00:10:16,326 --> 00:10:19,096
No matter how many times I try, you fall for this, Gantetsu!

164
00:10:20,998 --> 00:10:23,033
Ugh, cut it out already!

165
00:10:23,233 --> 00:10:24,101
Gantetsu!

166
00:10:32,442 --> 00:10:34,644
I'm telling you I'm not Gantetsu!

167
00:10:34,878 --> 00:10:38,048
If that's how you want to be, then I have an idea too!

168
00:10:39,216 --> 00:10:43,053
Oh! It's Mia-chan and Miyu-chan from Buffy!

169
00:10:43,453 --> 00:10:45,455
You fool, we won't fall for such trick.

170
00:10:45,655 --> 00:10:47,290
-Ryo-chan! -Eh?

171
00:10:47,491 --> 00:10:49,359
Eh? Eh? Eh?

172
00:10:50,027 --> 00:10:54,364
We're getting older

173
00:10:54,564 --> 00:10:56,500
But feeling fine!

174
00:10:56,733 --> 00:10:59,436
Buffy's Granny Mia

175
00:10:59,636 --> 00:11:00,837
And Granny Miyu!

176
00:11:03,073 --> 00:11:03,807
Gotcha!

177
00:11:10,213 --> 00:11:11,481
Damn it!

178
00:11:12,249 --> 00:11:13,950
Serves you right!

179
00:11:18,989 --> 00:11:19,623
Ryo-chan!

180
00:11:19,823 --> 00:11:20,657
Ryo-sama!

181
00:11:21,291 --> 00:11:22,459
What happened to your face?

182
00:11:22,659 --> 00:11:24,861
It's nothing serious, just a scratch.

183
00:11:25,095 --> 00:11:27,931
Are you okay, Ryotsu? What on earth happened?

184
00:11:28,498 --> 00:11:31,835
A group of six guys in martial arts uniforms suddenly attacked me,

185
00:11:32,069 --> 00:11:34,538
mistaking me for a man named Iwao Gantetsu.

186
00:11:34,771 --> 00:11:37,441
Iwao Gantetsu, he could be Maria-chan's...

187
00:11:37,641 --> 00:11:40,544
Yes, he was my coach when I was a kickboxer.

188
00:11:40,777 --> 00:11:42,946
Oh, I remember, his face looks just like Ryotsu's.

189
00:11:43,146 --> 00:11:46,683
Yes. Those who attacked him were probably my father's students.

190
00:11:46,883 --> 00:11:48,085
Students?

191
00:11:48,285 --> 00:11:50,887
My father is a martial artist and runs a dojo.

192
00:11:51,121 --> 00:11:53,290
They must have come looking for me.

193
00:11:53,657 --> 00:11:56,526
Does your father know that you've become a woman?

194
00:11:56,827 --> 00:11:57,661
He doesn't know.

195
00:11:57,861 --> 00:11:59,896
Your father will be shocked.

196
00:12:00,197 --> 00:12:02,265
He might be so shocked he'll be bedridden.

197
00:12:03,900 --> 00:12:04,734
Found him!

198
00:12:04,968 --> 00:12:07,704
We won't let you get away! I've contacted the grandmaster.

199
00:12:08,105 --> 00:12:09,106
You jerks!

200
00:12:09,306 --> 00:12:12,909
Help me, Ryo-sama! I don't want to go back to my father.

201
00:12:13,376 --> 00:12:17,047
Don't worry. They haven't noticed you yet.

202
00:12:17,447 --> 00:12:20,884
Hey, Gantetsu! Even disguised as a cop, you can't fool us with that face!

203
00:12:21,117 --> 00:12:22,719
I said you've got the wrong person!

204
00:12:22,919 --> 00:12:25,055
I'm Kankichi Ryotsu!

205
00:12:26,456 --> 00:12:27,057
Huh?

206
00:12:27,290 --> 00:12:28,225
Oh, here he is!

207
00:12:28,458 --> 00:12:30,060
The grandmaster has arrived!

208
00:12:35,532 --> 00:12:38,134
An auto rickshaw! Haven't seen one of those in ages!

209
00:12:38,335 --> 00:12:39,369
That's my father's car.

210
00:12:47,477 --> 00:12:48,078
Huh?

211
00:12:48,512 --> 00:12:51,081
I'm Ban Asato, the martial artist!

212
00:13:14,804 --> 00:13:16,973
Don't just pop out of nowhere like that!

213
00:13:17,207 --> 00:13:18,875
What is that auto rickshaw?

214
00:13:21,044 --> 00:13:22,879
That was just a one-off gag.

215
00:13:23,246 --> 00:13:24,881
What a dumb joke...

216
00:13:25,282 --> 00:13:27,617
Gantetsu, where did you take my son Ai?

217
00:13:27,884 --> 00:13:29,586
I'm not Gantetsu!

218
00:13:29,786 --> 00:13:31,788
This man isn't Coach Gantetsu.

219
00:13:31,988 --> 00:13:33,890
He's Kankichi Ryotsu-sama!

220
00:13:42,933 --> 00:13:44,801
This is bad. He'll be found out.

221
00:13:47,537 --> 00:13:48,738
Hey you... Eh?

222
00:13:49,306 --> 00:13:51,675
Officer, what time are you off duty today?

223
00:13:52,008 --> 00:13:56,146
I know a great French restaurant in Daikanyama.

224
00:13:56,379 --> 00:13:58,315
Would you like to have dinner with me tonight?

225
00:13:58,548 --> 00:13:59,816
N-No way...

226
00:14:00,383 --> 00:14:02,252
How about taking sticker photos together?

227
00:14:02,452 --> 00:14:04,821
Could you give me your number too?

228
00:14:05,422 --> 00:14:07,591
He's hitting on his own child.

229
00:14:07,791 --> 00:14:10,827
But isn't it normal for a parent and child to eat together?

230
00:14:11,628 --> 00:14:14,297
I feel like I've met you somewhere before.

231
00:14:14,497 --> 00:14:18,034
Weren't you working as a companion in Roppongi before?

232
00:14:18,668 --> 00:14:21,171
Grandmaster! Don't switch into Roppongi mode now!

233
00:14:21,404 --> 00:14:22,839
Focus on Gantetsu first!

234
00:14:23,473 --> 00:14:25,041
Oh, that's right, I forgot.

235
00:14:25,275 --> 00:14:27,010
Hey, Gantetsu! Where's my son?

236
00:14:27,243 --> 00:14:29,112
I told you I'm not Gantetsu!

237
00:14:29,312 --> 00:14:32,015
You just met your son a minute ago!

238
00:14:33,283 --> 00:14:33,950
What?

239
00:14:42,259 --> 00:14:43,193
Ah!

240
00:14:43,526 --> 00:14:44,361
Ai!

241
00:14:44,594 --> 00:14:46,696
Have you become a woman?

242
00:14:47,063 --> 00:14:49,199
Yes, Father.

243
00:14:49,432 --> 00:14:51,368
Oh my God!

244
00:14:52,435 --> 00:14:56,640
Oh my spaghetti, lasagna, borscht, pizza, frankfurters!

245
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:59,342
What the hell!

246
00:14:59,542 --> 00:15:01,378
Grandmaster, get a hold of yourself!

247
00:15:01,678 --> 00:15:04,614
Forget about me, Father.

248
00:15:04,814 --> 00:15:09,552
What? Don't you dare say something like that!

249
00:15:11,154 --> 00:15:14,157
The one destined to inherit the Hondara Kempo I invented

250
00:15:14,457 --> 00:15:15,458
is you!

251
00:15:16,359 --> 00:15:18,862
That's why I had you trained from childhood with a coach,

252
00:15:19,062 --> 00:15:20,930
mastering every martial art,

253
00:15:21,164 --> 00:15:26,303
karate, judo, wrestling, kickboxing...

254
00:15:26,836 --> 00:15:30,774
You were meant to rise to the top of them all.

255
00:15:31,007 --> 00:15:31,675
And then,

256
00:15:33,176 --> 00:15:36,646
in my place, you would become the grandmaster of Hondara Kempo.

257
00:15:43,119 --> 00:15:46,389
You would face Andy Trafug in the K-1 Grand Prix,

258
00:15:47,757 --> 00:15:49,926
defeat him with a heel drop,

259
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:53,496
and spread Hondara Kempo across the world!

260
00:15:55,031 --> 00:15:59,402
But when you reached the first step of becoming the kickboxing champion,

261
00:15:59,602 --> 00:16:02,672
not only did you run off with Coach Gantetsu,

262
00:16:02,872 --> 00:16:05,208
you turned into a woman...

263
00:16:05,709 --> 00:16:08,812
Finally tracking down his son, only to find out he's a woman now...

264
00:16:09,045 --> 00:16:10,680
That's gonna be a serious shock.

265
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:14,951
Of course. Makes him wonder why he had his son train in the first place.

266
00:16:15,285 --> 00:16:17,520
-Ai, go back to the dojo. -No.

267
00:16:17,721 --> 00:16:20,056
You are the only one who can take over the Asato legacy!

268
00:16:20,256 --> 00:16:21,991
There's also Rin, my sister.

269
00:16:22,225 --> 00:16:23,393
She's a woman!

270
00:16:23,593 --> 00:16:24,294
Oh, no!

271
00:16:26,229 --> 00:16:28,531
You're sexy up close.

272
00:16:29,566 --> 00:16:31,067
Don't stare at your son!

273
00:16:31,267 --> 00:16:32,802
You dirty old man!

274
00:16:33,002 --> 00:16:33,837
Grandmaster!

275
00:16:34,070 --> 00:16:36,306
You fake Gantetsu!

276
00:16:36,639 --> 00:16:37,774
-Ryo-sama! -Huh?

277
00:16:38,174 --> 00:16:40,009
I don't want to go back!

278
00:16:40,243 --> 00:16:41,077
Ugh.

279
00:16:41,311 --> 00:16:42,278
I-I get it.

280
00:16:42,779 --> 00:16:44,647
I'll protect you, I promise!

281
00:16:44,848 --> 00:16:45,749
Ryo-sama...

282
00:16:46,449 --> 00:16:47,817
Now, I have no choice.

283
00:16:48,017 --> 00:16:49,285
Even if you're an amateur,

284
00:16:49,486 --> 00:16:51,988
I'll use martial arts to bring Ai back!

285
00:16:52,188 --> 00:16:53,022
Get ready!

286
00:17:00,597 --> 00:17:01,197
Hah!

287
00:17:01,431 --> 00:17:03,199
Ryo-sama, my father's martial art is...

288
00:17:03,733 --> 00:17:05,502
Hondara Kempo, Ultimate Technique!

289
00:17:06,669 --> 00:17:07,337
Spit Dance!

290
00:17:07,670 --> 00:17:08,505
Ew, gross! Nasty!

291
00:17:09,038 --> 00:17:10,507
-Take this, this, this! -Ow ow ow!

292
00:17:12,442 --> 00:17:13,743
See that? Spit Dance.

293
00:17:14,277 --> 00:17:16,880
What kind of style is that! Just like a kid's fight!

294
00:17:17,347 --> 00:17:20,417
It's so embarrassing, I don't even wanna inherit it.

295
00:17:21,151 --> 00:17:22,652
How could you say that, Ai!

296
00:17:23,653 --> 00:17:25,288
Take the Second Fist!

297
00:17:29,058 --> 00:17:31,628
Hondara Fist, Ear Yank!

298
00:17:31,828 --> 00:17:32,462
Ouch, stop!

299
00:17:33,062 --> 00:17:35,598
-Ouch, ouch, ouch. -Did I miss?

300
00:17:35,799 --> 00:17:37,333
Not bad, huh?

301
00:17:37,534 --> 00:17:38,468
Then, how about this?

302
00:17:42,605 --> 00:17:44,240
-Owww! -Ryo-sama!

303
00:17:45,241 --> 00:17:47,477
See that? Hondara Fist, Kin-chan Kick.

304
00:17:47,677 --> 00:17:48,678
Great, Grandmaster.

305
00:17:48,878 --> 00:17:49,879
Payback for earlier!

306
00:17:50,079 --> 00:17:52,382
You keep using nothing but dirty tricks!

307
00:17:52,849 --> 00:17:54,451
-Ryo-chan! -Ryotsu!

308
00:17:54,651 --> 00:17:57,053
Even if you're my father, I can't forgive what you did!

309
00:17:57,253 --> 00:17:59,856
Maria! Have you forgotten your promise to me?

310
00:18:00,390 --> 00:18:02,392
No matter what happens, you must never fight!

311
00:18:02,725 --> 00:18:04,360
I'll be his opponent!

312
00:18:04,928 --> 00:18:05,995
Ryo-sama...

313
00:18:06,196 --> 00:18:07,897
Hey, Hondara old man!

314
00:18:08,097 --> 00:18:09,098
Come outside!

315
00:18:09,632 --> 00:18:11,468
You idiot. All right.

316
00:18:11,668 --> 00:18:14,471
I'll make you feel Hondara Fist down to your bones! Come!

317
00:18:14,671 --> 00:18:16,072
-Yeah! -Ryo-sama!

318
00:18:18,575 --> 00:18:19,475
Grandmaster!

319
00:18:19,676 --> 00:18:20,910
-Ryotsu! -Ryo-chan!

320
00:18:24,481 --> 00:18:25,915
This time, I won't hold back!

321
00:18:26,282 --> 00:18:28,384
That's my line!

322
00:18:38,528 --> 00:18:40,363
Whoa! My eyes!

323
00:18:41,498 --> 00:18:42,499
How's that?!

324
00:18:42,699 --> 00:18:46,870
You! Using Hondara Kempo, Secret Move, Sand Throw Granny!

325
00:18:47,136 --> 00:18:49,239
Every kid in downtown knows it!

326
00:18:49,672 --> 00:18:51,307
Here comes Downtown Kempo!

327
00:18:53,509 --> 00:18:56,246
Head Bite!

328
00:19:06,789 --> 00:19:07,957
Ryo-sama!

329
00:19:08,992 --> 00:19:10,393
Thank you.

330
00:19:12,695 --> 00:19:14,964
Ryo-san, what have you done?!

331
00:19:15,164 --> 00:19:16,432
Ryo-sama!

332
00:19:16,633 --> 00:19:18,635
-Don't be mad at Ryo-sama! -Eh?

333
00:19:20,536 --> 00:19:23,306
Ryo-sama is fighting for me!

334
00:19:23,540 --> 00:19:24,641
Hey!

335
00:19:24,874 --> 00:19:26,643
Cut out the flirting!

336
00:19:27,777 --> 00:19:31,648
Is that so! Ryo-san finally has a girlfriend!

337
00:19:33,483 --> 00:19:35,118
Ryo-san, use these!

338
00:19:35,418 --> 00:19:37,120
Oh, thanks!

339
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:38,354
Ai!

340
00:19:39,489 --> 00:19:41,291
Downtown Kempo Ultimate Technique,

341
00:19:41,491 --> 00:19:43,626
Foolish Eggplant Strike!

342
00:19:45,094 --> 00:19:45,895
How's that?!

343
00:19:46,095 --> 00:19:47,563
Grandmaster!

344
00:19:52,835 --> 00:19:54,771
Serves you right! Let's go!

345
00:19:54,971 --> 00:19:55,805
Yes!

346
00:19:56,005 --> 00:19:56,940
Thank you, ma'am!

347
00:19:57,140 --> 00:19:58,207
Good luck!

348
00:20:00,476 --> 00:20:02,312
I'll never forgive you!

349
00:20:02,946 --> 00:20:05,048
Burn! Burn! Burn!

350
00:20:05,281 --> 00:20:07,450
The grandmaster's eyes are on fire!

351
00:20:07,650 --> 00:20:08,484
Huh?

352
00:20:08,685 --> 00:20:12,188
KIDS, DO NOT TRY THIS AT HOME!

353
00:20:13,122 --> 00:20:13,957
Ah!

354
00:20:16,125 --> 00:20:18,928
Whoa, somebody put it out!

355
00:20:20,964 --> 00:20:22,598
Grandmaster! Get a hold of yourself!

356
00:20:22,799 --> 00:20:24,133
Where is that fake Gantetsu?

357
00:20:24,334 --> 00:20:26,369
Hey! You idiot, Ban-chan!

358
00:20:26,636 --> 00:20:27,870
Are you seriously dumb?

359
00:20:28,638 --> 00:20:29,706
Bleh!

360
00:20:30,206 --> 00:20:31,341
You!

361
00:20:31,774 --> 00:20:32,608
Grandmaster!

362
00:20:32,809 --> 00:20:34,644
Be sure to defeat him!

363
00:20:34,844 --> 00:20:35,979
Oh man...

364
00:20:36,179 --> 00:20:37,413
This is bad.

365
00:20:37,647 --> 00:20:38,948
What's gonna happen?

366
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:45,955
Wait, fake Gantetsu!

367
00:20:51,361 --> 00:20:52,729
Welcome.

368
00:20:55,965 --> 00:20:56,699
Hey, old man.

369
00:20:56,899 --> 00:20:57,567
Yep.

370
00:20:57,800 --> 00:20:59,736
Did a cop just walk in here?

371
00:21:00,203 --> 00:21:03,239
Nah, you're the first customer today.

372
00:21:03,439 --> 00:21:05,041
Huh? That can't be...

373
00:21:06,409 --> 00:21:07,243
Well, whatever.

374
00:21:09,212 --> 00:21:10,647
Make me look like Takuya Kimura.

375
00:21:13,449 --> 00:21:15,218
Hey, old man, what are you doing?

376
00:21:15,418 --> 00:21:18,988
Sir, falling for a trick like this, you're way too gullible!

377
00:21:20,757 --> 00:21:22,291
Ta-da!

378
00:21:22,525 --> 00:21:23,593
It's you!

379
00:21:23,826 --> 00:21:24,761
Gotcha!

380
00:21:25,428 --> 00:21:28,131
Here we go! Downtown Kempo, Wild Top Spin!

381
00:21:32,235 --> 00:21:34,404
I-I'm dizzy!

382
00:21:34,737 --> 00:21:37,907
Here we go, spin, spin, spin, spin, spin!

383
00:21:47,016 --> 00:21:48,785
I feel sick...

384
00:21:50,486 --> 00:21:52,288
Now, for the finishing touch...

385
00:21:59,395 --> 00:22:01,764
Secret Move, Buzz Cut Slash!

386
00:22:01,964 --> 00:22:03,933
Ultimate Technique, Beard Eraser!

387
00:22:05,635 --> 00:22:06,402
Here it is!

388
00:22:06,602 --> 00:22:07,804
-Ryo-sama! -Grandmaster!

389
00:22:09,439 --> 00:22:10,706
Ohhh!

390
00:22:13,576 --> 00:22:15,511
I... I give up...

391
00:22:17,814 --> 00:22:18,714
Grandmaster...

392
00:22:18,915 --> 00:22:19,749
Ryo-sama!

393
00:22:19,949 --> 00:22:20,650
Maria!

394
00:22:20,883 --> 00:22:23,886
Ryo-sama, you won! Thank you for fighting for me!

395
00:22:24,087 --> 00:22:26,355
That's what happens when I get a little serious!

396
00:22:26,589 --> 00:22:27,290
Ai...

397
00:22:28,091 --> 00:22:29,192
I lost.

398
00:22:29,425 --> 00:22:31,427
Ai, I won't force you anymore.

399
00:22:31,627 --> 00:22:33,529
Live your life as you wish.

400
00:22:34,430 --> 00:22:36,532
Thank you, Father.

401
00:22:37,533 --> 00:22:38,301
Hmm.

402
00:22:38,768 --> 00:22:40,536
Good for you, Maria.

403
00:22:40,903 --> 00:22:42,605
Thank you everyone.

404
00:22:42,805 --> 00:22:47,310
I'm glad we settled things peacefully.

405
00:22:47,543 --> 00:22:49,212
Peacefully?

406
00:22:49,445 --> 00:22:51,180
Oh dear.

407
00:22:51,380 --> 00:22:52,648
But...

408
00:22:52,849 --> 00:22:54,283
Instead!

409
00:22:54,484 --> 00:22:55,318
Eh?

410
00:22:55,518 --> 00:22:57,086
Kankichi Ryotsu!

411
00:22:57,754 --> 00:23:00,690
You'll inherit Hondara Kempo!

412
00:23:00,923 --> 00:23:02,191
What?!

413
00:23:02,391 --> 00:23:03,626
Men, seize him!

414
00:23:03,826 --> 00:23:04,861
Yes, sir!

415
00:23:05,661 --> 00:23:07,163
Hey! Stop! Ahhh!

416
00:23:08,131 --> 00:23:09,365
Ryo-sama!

417
00:23:10,333 --> 00:23:11,634
Stop, stop!

418
00:23:11,834 --> 00:23:12,668
Ryo-sama!

419
00:23:13,336 --> 00:23:15,304
I said stop! Let me go!

420
00:23:15,505 --> 00:23:16,806
Here we go!

421
00:23:17,473 --> 00:23:18,808
Ouch, ouch...

422
00:23:21,410 --> 00:23:23,246
What? What's going on?

423
00:23:24,147 --> 00:23:27,683
That strength and the way he's naturally mastered Hondara techniques...

424
00:23:28,117 --> 00:23:30,386
From today, you are Kankichi Asato!

425
00:23:30,586 --> 00:23:33,523
I'm not inheriting such ridiculous kempo!

426
00:23:33,890 --> 00:23:34,791
Ryo-sama!

427
00:23:34,991 --> 00:23:36,893
Maria, do something about these guys!

428
00:23:37,393 --> 00:23:40,163
But I promised not to fight...

429
00:23:40,363 --> 00:23:42,131
Forget that promise!

430
00:23:42,331 --> 00:23:43,533
Just help me!

431
00:23:44,667 --> 00:23:47,236
All right, let's go!

432
00:23:50,973 --> 00:23:52,241
Ryo-sama!

433
00:23:52,441 --> 00:23:54,510
Don't go!

434
00:23:54,710 --> 00:23:57,580
I don't wanna go!
